-- Migration: 0102_meal_recipe_goal_tags_part3
-- Target: Cloudflare D1 (SQLite)
-- Part 3/3: backfills goal_tags for the 1280 recipes that
-- have a calorie/macro estimate — using macro RATIOS (share of calories from
-- protein/fat), not absolute calorie thresholds, since these are whole-dish
-- totals with no real per-person serving count. Ratios stay meaningful
-- regardless of how many people a dish actually serves; absolute kcal
-- cutoffs wouldn't. maintain is always included as a baseline; gain_muscle
-- when protein >=25% of calories, lose_weight when fat <=20%, gain_weight
-- when fat >=40% — a dish can get more than one tag. The other 1225
-- recipes (no calorie estimate) are left untagged rather than guessed.
